WEBVTT

00:01:34.461 --> 00:01:35.450
Saya...

00:01:37.931 --> 00:01:39.398
Shindo!

00:01:40.767 --> 00:01:42.758
Ranmaru, what happened!?

00:01:43.603 --> 00:01:44.934
It can't be!

00:01:45.171 --> 00:01:49.938
Dark

00:02:05.358 --> 00:02:06.655
You're using this place?

00:02:06.693 --> 00:02:07.682
Yes.

00:02:07.727 --> 00:02:11.686
I felt it would be
the most appropriate place for you,

00:02:11.731 --> 00:02:12.720
Inspector Ibuki.

00:02:13.766 --> 00:02:14.892
Well, thank you.

00:02:14.934 --> 00:02:18.370
Your friends might try and come
to rescue you after all.

00:02:19.572 --> 00:02:21.005
I'm sorry,

00:02:21.040 --> 00:02:22.905
but it would probably be best
to rid yourself of that hope.

00:02:23.576 --> 00:02:25.635
As you know,

00:02:25.678 --> 00:02:27.407
this room is made
out of special materials.

00:02:27.447 --> 00:02:29.438
Yes, I know that well.

00:02:29.482 --> 00:02:32.940
Well, you'll be out of here soon.

00:02:32.986 --> 00:02:36.820
After all, it won't take a lot of time
for Taishi to settle this.

00:02:43.296 --> 00:02:45.025
Shindo!

00:02:45.064 --> 00:02:46.156
Ranmaru!

00:02:46.199 --> 00:02:48.429
Get a hold of yourself!

00:02:48.468 --> 00:02:49.799
Saya.

00:02:49.836 --> 00:02:51.167
What happened to Saya!?

00:02:53.039 --> 00:02:54.563
Saya's going to be killed...

00:02:54.607 --> 00:02:56.165
...by that man...

00:02:56.209 --> 00:02:57.506
Calm down!

00:02:57.544 --> 00:02:58.533
Get out of my way!

00:03:14.260 --> 00:03:16.592
Listen carefully, Ranmaru.

00:03:17.463 --> 00:03:18.623
That man will come...

00:03:18.665 --> 00:03:22.123
...and take advantage of the hatred
and sadness in our hearts.

00:03:23.903 --> 00:03:25.268
You understand...

00:03:25.305 --> 00:03:28.433
...how dangerous the situation
you're in is, right?

00:03:31.010 --> 00:03:32.568
Ryouko's been arrested.

00:03:32.612 --> 00:03:33.874
What?

00:03:34.814 --> 00:03:37.749
She'll probably
be dealt with tonight.

00:03:43.957 --> 00:03:46.391
This is the Security Section.

00:03:46.426 --> 00:03:47.484
Open up!

00:03:47.527 --> 00:03:50.690
They came here,
just as I thought they would.

00:03:50.730 --> 00:03:53.665
I wonder if slapping Ogata
was a bit too much.

00:03:54.968 --> 00:03:57.368
There's a warrant out
for your arrest.

00:03:57.403 --> 00:03:58.392
Open up.

00:03:59.205 --> 00:04:00.433
What do we do?

00:04:00.473 --> 00:04:01.906
Well...

00:04:18.658 --> 00:04:19.716
What did you say?

00:04:19.759 --> 00:04:21.624
You let Shindo get away?

00:04:21.661 --> 00:04:22.889
Capture him, quickly.

00:04:22.929 --> 00:04:24.726
It doesn't matter if you kill him.

00:04:25.832 --> 00:04:27.823
What? You idiot!

00:04:27.867 --> 00:04:29.164
If we don't deal with him now,

00:04:29.202 --> 00:04:30.464
then we'll be
endangering things here!

00:04:30.503 --> 00:04:32.300
Don't you understand that!?

00:04:32.338 --> 00:04:34.738
Who's going to be in danger?

00:04:35.775 --> 00:04:36.799
Huh?

00:04:36.843 --> 00:04:38.071
Chief.

00:04:38.111 --> 00:04:42.741
What are you doing here,
Muramasa?

00:04:42.782 --> 00:04:45.774
When did you transfer
to the Security Section?

00:04:47.420 --> 00:04:51.618
And what do you mean
by 'endanger things here'?

00:04:53.326 --> 00:04:56.261
How about saying something?

00:05:05.338 --> 00:05:08.774
Security Section HQ
is right above us.

00:05:08.808 --> 00:05:10.207
Where's Ryouko?

00:05:10.243 --> 00:05:12.711
She's probably
in the special cell.

00:05:12.745 --> 00:05:14.269
The special cell...

00:05:16.349 --> 00:05:17.941
That room has a door...

00:05:17.984 --> 00:05:21.750
...made out of a special kind of steel
and it's more secure than a vault.

00:05:21.788 --> 00:05:26.157
It was originally a facility
for holding symbionts like us.

00:05:27.527 --> 00:05:28.926
Rokujo...

00:05:29.962 --> 00:05:32.294
I'm sorry about earlier...

00:05:32.332 --> 00:05:34.596
I was just so worked up,

00:05:35.268 --> 00:05:37.759
I didn't even think about
how you might feel...

00:05:42.241 --> 00:05:43.970
Rokujo...

00:05:44.010 --> 00:05:45.204
Ranmaru.

00:05:45.244 --> 00:05:46.233
Yes?

00:05:46.279 --> 00:05:48.509
Leave Ryouko to us.

00:05:48.548 --> 00:05:49.537
What?

00:05:49.582 --> 00:05:51.607
You go look for Saya.

00:05:51.651 --> 00:05:52.982
But...

00:05:53.019 --> 00:05:55.249
The two of us will be fine.

00:05:55.288 --> 00:05:56.812
We'll meet up with you...

00:05:56.856 --> 00:05:58.187
...as soon as we rescue Ryouko.

00:06:00.927 --> 00:06:03.623
I think you already know this,

00:06:03.663 --> 00:06:05.494
but Saya's...

00:06:05.531 --> 00:06:06.520
A symbiont...

00:06:08.067 --> 00:06:12.060
Actually, I've known it
for a long time...

00:06:12.105 --> 00:06:14.733
She did say that it was like
she was always protected...

00:06:14.774 --> 00:06:16.469
...by something...

00:06:19.312 --> 00:06:21.212
So I was prepared...

00:06:22.215 --> 00:06:24.843
...because she was
my younger sister...

00:06:28.721 --> 00:06:30.382
Why you!

00:06:30.423 --> 00:06:32.050
I've got evidence
that you're a spy...

00:06:32.091 --> 00:06:34.559
...for the Security Section!

00:06:35.228 --> 00:06:37.219
What in the world's
the meaning of this!?

00:06:37.263 --> 00:06:40.721
As I said...
in order to avoid panic...

00:06:40.767 --> 00:06:42.667
...this action was
absolutely necessary.

00:06:44.137 --> 00:06:45.832
Bastard!

00:06:46.939 --> 00:06:48.668
Don't mess with me!

00:06:49.709 --> 00:06:51.700
Avoid panic, you say!?

00:06:51.744 --> 00:06:52.802
Don't joke with me!

00:06:52.845 --> 00:06:56.110
How many of my men do you think
have died for that!?

00:06:57.316 --> 00:06:58.943
What are you planning?

00:06:58.985 --> 00:07:02.614
Planning?
Nothing in particular...

00:07:02.655 --> 00:07:06.716
All I'm doing is carrying out
my orders.

00:07:06.759 --> 00:07:09.819
Orders? Whose orders?

00:07:11.330 --> 00:07:13.321
You know the true identity...

00:07:13.366 --> 00:07:15.960
...of those monsters,
don't you, you bastard?

00:07:16.002 --> 00:07:18.368
This has nothing to do with you.

00:07:18.404 --> 00:07:20.269
What was that?

00:07:20.306 --> 00:07:21.500
You bastard!

00:07:42.929 --> 00:07:46.695
Hey, you said something about
dealing with Shindo earlier, right?

00:07:46.732 --> 00:07:48.962
What did you mean by that?

00:07:50.236 --> 00:07:54.172
Why is the Security Section
killing off members of the S.M.I. F?

00:07:55.408 --> 00:07:57.399
Huh? Hey!

00:07:57.443 --> 00:07:58.774
Not gonna say!?

00:07:58.811 --> 00:08:00.278
Why you!

00:08:00.313 --> 00:08:01.837
Spit it out!

00:08:02.748 --> 00:08:03.772
Saya...

00:08:03.816 --> 00:08:05.249
...where are you?

00:08:05.284 --> 00:08:07.047
Where are you?

00:08:07.086 --> 00:08:08.781
Answer me!

00:08:12.291 --> 00:08:14.282
Saya...

00:08:14.327 --> 00:08:15.487
...no matter what...

00:08:15.528 --> 00:08:18.656
No matter what,
I'm going to save you...

00:08:18.698 --> 00:08:20.529
You're that guy
from before, right?

00:08:21.501 --> 00:08:24.061
You...

00:08:24.103 --> 00:08:25.468
I heard your voice...

00:08:25.505 --> 00:08:26.836
What?

00:08:26.873 --> 00:08:29.569
You have the same power I do,
don't you?

00:08:31.177 --> 00:08:32.610
Yo.

00:08:37.550 --> 00:08:40.917
What are you two planning
on doing from here on?

00:08:40.953 --> 00:08:42.318
Planning?

00:08:42.355 --> 00:08:43.947
We're going to keep doing
what we're doing.

00:08:43.990 --> 00:08:45.514
You're going to keep
hunting them?

00:08:45.558 --> 00:08:48.391
Yeah... until they're
eradicated.

00:08:49.862 --> 00:08:51.887
Hey, how about you...

00:08:54.500 --> 00:08:55.592
Big brother!

00:08:55.635 --> 00:08:57.227
What's wrong?

00:08:57.270 --> 00:08:58.362
That man is coming!

00:08:58.404 --> 00:09:00.133
What did you say!?

00:09:01.407 --> 00:09:02.840
Mayu!

00:09:03.876 --> 00:09:05.605
It would be best
if you hid, too.

00:09:05.645 --> 00:09:06.634
What's going on?

00:09:06.679 --> 00:09:08.909
- He's coming!
- He?

00:09:08.948 --> 00:09:12.247
The man that captures
hunters like us.

00:09:22.962 --> 00:09:24.554
It can't be...

00:09:30.403 --> 00:09:32.030
It's all right now.

00:09:33.339 --> 00:09:35.773
What do you mean?

00:09:35.808 --> 00:09:37.298
They're going to be
taken away.

00:09:37.343 --> 00:09:38.332
What?

00:09:39.145 --> 00:09:41.511
Where are they going
to be taken to?

00:09:41.547 --> 00:09:43.777
The apartment complex
in Machida.

00:09:43.816 --> 00:09:45.147
Then what'll happen to them!?

00:09:45.184 --> 00:09:47.675
They'll either be killed
and made into fragments

00:09:47.720 --> 00:09:49.517
or thrown into the hole.

00:09:55.027 --> 00:09:56.016
I see.

00:09:56.729 --> 00:09:58.720
So that's why there's
no visible security...

00:10:01.267 --> 00:10:02.529
Here we go!

00:10:16.315 --> 00:10:17.304
She's in there.

00:10:17.350 --> 00:10:18.339
Ryouko!

00:10:24.824 --> 00:10:25.813
Ryouko!

00:10:26.826 --> 00:10:27.815
It's no use.

00:10:29.161 --> 00:10:31.288
The only way it can
be destroyed...

00:10:31.330 --> 00:10:33.321
...is with a powerful explosive.

00:10:34.066 --> 00:10:36.330
There's a warrant out
for your arrest.

00:10:37.303 --> 00:10:38.327
It's a hoax.

00:10:39.205 --> 00:10:40.866
What are you planning
on doing?

00:10:40.906 --> 00:10:43.340
The exit is blocked off
by the Security Section.

00:10:43.376 --> 00:10:45.640
There's no place for you to run.

00:10:45.678 --> 00:10:49.114
Sorry, but we can't
just abandon Ryouko.

00:10:49.782 --> 00:10:50.874
What about you, Inspector?

00:10:50.916 --> 00:10:53.384
What are you doing
in a place like this?

00:10:53.419 --> 00:10:56.047
Did you come all this way
just to arrest us?

00:10:56.088 --> 00:10:58.921
Heh... that might not be
a bad idea...

00:10:58.958 --> 00:11:00.892
It'd be payback for everything
previously.

00:11:01.927 --> 00:11:06.057
Hey... why do you fight
so hard?

00:11:06.098 --> 00:11:08.430
Mind your own business.

00:11:08.467 --> 00:11:11.834
Jeez, but you are such a brat.

00:11:11.871 --> 00:11:14.431
How about if you
went home already, Inspector?

00:11:14.473 --> 00:11:15.940
Ruru is waiting for you.

00:11:15.975 --> 00:11:16.964
Hmph.

00:11:17.009 --> 00:11:18.943
And that is none
of your business.

00:11:18.978 --> 00:11:20.707
Kureha, we have to hurry.

00:11:20.746 --> 00:11:22.338
Right.

00:11:22.381 --> 00:11:23.848
There's one thing
I want to confirm.

00:11:23.883 --> 00:11:24.941
What?

00:11:24.984 --> 00:11:28.920
Are you those monsters' enemies
or allies?

00:11:28.954 --> 00:11:30.546
Isn't that obvious?

00:11:38.197 --> 00:11:39.960
This is plastic explosive.

00:11:39.999 --> 00:11:42.934
I took it from the impound.

00:11:42.968 --> 00:11:43.957
Why?

00:11:44.003 --> 00:11:46.335
Hey, if you don't hurry up,

00:11:46.372 --> 00:11:48.397
the guys from the Security Section
are going to show up.

00:11:53.946 --> 00:11:54.935
Ryouko.

00:11:59.752 --> 00:12:01.447
Is Shindo doing all right?

00:12:01.487 --> 00:12:04.012
He's doing his best.
Thanks for asking.

00:12:04.056 --> 00:12:05.990
I see...

00:12:06.025 --> 00:12:08.858
Then tell him I said hi.

00:12:08.894 --> 00:12:10.122
Roger!

00:12:11.163 --> 00:12:13.393
Inspector... thank you.

00:12:16.068 --> 00:12:18.332
It'd be best if you guys
got out of here in a hurry.

00:12:27.680 --> 00:12:29.307
Now, then...

00:12:29.348 --> 00:12:31.407
Ruru, it looks like
my chance has come...

00:12:33.953 --> 00:12:36.683
With this,
I can finally go home!

00:12:53.773 --> 00:12:54.967
Saya...

00:12:55.007 --> 00:12:56.440
Saya!

00:12:56.475 --> 00:12:58.340
I've been waiting for you,

00:12:58.377 --> 00:13:00.140
Ranmaru Shindo.

00:13:00.179 --> 00:13:01.669
Where's Saya!?

00:13:01.714 --> 00:13:04.683
There's no need to worry,
she's all right.

00:13:04.717 --> 00:13:07.117
But I still haven't finished
the preparations...

00:13:07.153 --> 00:13:10.281
...for handing her over to you
as a present.

00:13:10.322 --> 00:13:11.380
Don't mess with me!

00:13:11.423 --> 00:13:13.015
Come out!

00:13:13.058 --> 00:13:14.650
We're going
to settle things today!

00:13:14.693 --> 00:13:17.161
So you want to fight me,
do you?

00:13:17.196 --> 00:13:19.926
Yeah! I'm going to kill you!

00:13:19.965 --> 00:13:21.432
Very well.

00:13:21.467 --> 00:13:25.836
But before that, there is something
you need to know.

00:13:25.871 --> 00:13:27.031
And what's that?

00:13:27.072 --> 00:13:29.097
The truth about everything.

00:13:30.476 --> 00:13:35.573
Do you know why
I'm doing this?

00:13:35.614 --> 00:13:36.672
Heh.

00:13:36.715 --> 00:13:39.445
I'm tired of hearing
about stupid crap...

00:13:39.485 --> 00:13:41.453
...like evolution or providence!

00:13:41.487 --> 00:13:45.617
In short, you devils are trying
to destroy us humans!

00:13:45.658 --> 00:13:47.091
That is incorrect.

00:13:47.126 --> 00:13:48.218
What did you say!?

00:13:48.260 --> 00:13:54.631
Humans are the ones
that created what I am.

00:13:54.667 --> 00:13:55.895
Saya has been taken!?

00:13:55.935 --> 00:13:58.631
They're probably planning on
awakening her.

00:13:58.671 --> 00:13:59.660
How horrible...

00:13:59.705 --> 00:14:02.435
I hope Ranmaru makes it
in time...

00:14:07.179 --> 00:14:11.775
I was a symbiont
just like you.

00:14:17.356 --> 00:14:22.157
A certain group of aristocrats
ordered twelve alchemists...

00:14:22.194 --> 00:14:24.025
...to summon devils,

00:14:24.063 --> 00:14:28.591
and tried to take over the world
using that power.

00:14:39.378 --> 00:14:43.712
But the Box of Druj
was sealed away.

00:14:44.750 --> 00:14:48.117
I've been searching
for the 108 parts...

00:14:48.153 --> 00:14:51.520
...in order to call them back
once more.

00:14:51.557 --> 00:14:54.287
It's been hundreds of years.

00:14:55.261 --> 00:14:58.458
And I finally found it.

00:14:58.497 --> 00:14:59.964
The last piece,

00:14:59.999 --> 00:15:01.660
in this city.

00:15:07.406 --> 00:15:10.000
Surely you've realized it
by now...

00:15:10.042 --> 00:15:12.772
...the fact that you are
the chosen one.

00:15:12.811 --> 00:15:16.713
What the hell is with
this 'chosen one' stuff!?

00:15:16.749 --> 00:15:20.185
Eventually, you will kill
the remaining symbionts...

00:15:20.219 --> 00:15:22.687
...and gain that power.

00:15:22.721 --> 00:15:23.983
Shut up!

00:15:32.831 --> 00:15:34.230
I'm sorry,

00:15:34.266 --> 00:15:36.291
but you can't face me
as you are right now.

00:15:48.080 --> 00:15:49.445
Come on!

00:16:23.315 --> 00:16:25.010
Hmph... it's not over yet.

00:16:55.614 --> 00:16:56.638
Rokujo.

00:17:03.188 --> 00:17:05.315
- Kureha!
- Kureha!

00:17:05.357 --> 00:17:08.087
Damn it...

00:17:18.704 --> 00:17:19.728
Kureha!

00:17:22.541 --> 00:17:24.031
I'm all right.

00:17:24.076 --> 00:17:26.044
Don't worry about me.

00:17:26.078 --> 00:17:28.239
Hurry up and follow him.

00:17:28.280 --> 00:17:29.269
But...

00:17:29.314 --> 00:17:32.181
If you don't hurry,
then Saya will...

00:17:55.974 --> 00:17:57.737
Are you all right, Rokujo?

00:17:57.776 --> 00:17:59.505
Yes.

00:17:59.545 --> 00:18:00.944
Big brother.

00:18:03.949 --> 00:18:05.314
Saya! Saya!

00:18:05.350 --> 00:18:06.339
Wait!

00:18:13.592 --> 00:18:15.924
Saya! Are you all right?

00:18:20.766 --> 00:18:22.256
Shindo!

00:18:41.386 --> 00:18:42.375
Shindo.

00:18:42.421 --> 00:18:43.888
Hmm?

00:18:43.922 --> 00:18:46.117
Use my power.

00:18:46.158 --> 00:18:48.149
What?

00:18:48.193 --> 00:18:51.526
Kill me with your sword.

00:18:51.563 --> 00:18:52.757
What are you saying?

00:18:52.798 --> 00:18:56.029
If you do that,
then my power will be yours.

00:18:56.068 --> 00:18:57.433
Don't say stupid things
like that!

00:18:57.469 --> 00:19:00.131
I can't do that!

00:19:00.172 --> 00:19:04.336
There probably isn't any other way
to beat Taishi.

00:19:06.545 --> 00:19:10.504
I was able to go inside of you.

00:19:10.549 --> 00:19:14.713
We possess a strange kind
of resonance.

00:19:14.753 --> 00:19:15.811
It might be that...

00:19:15.854 --> 00:19:17.344
Don't joke!

00:19:19.091 --> 00:19:20.649
Why are you saying that?

00:19:22.194 --> 00:19:25.561
Because I knew that this
would happen some day.

00:19:30.102 --> 00:19:31.228
Shindo.

00:19:31.270 --> 00:19:33.033
I can't!

00:19:36.041 --> 00:19:37.030
Hurry!

00:19:37.075 --> 00:19:38.269
Stop it!

00:19:38.310 --> 00:19:40.005
I can't...

00:19:40.045 --> 00:19:42.138
I can't do that!

00:19:42.181 --> 00:19:44.979
Stop it, Rokujo!

00:19:45.017 --> 00:19:46.985
You're going
to save Saya, right?

00:19:52.891 --> 00:19:54.222
Stop it, Rokujo!

00:20:02.768 --> 00:20:05.669
Ro-Rokujo...

00:20:05.704 --> 00:20:09.037
Shin... do...

00:20:09.074 --> 00:20:12.305
This... is...

00:20:12.344 --> 00:20:16.781
I... will be with you...

00:20:18.083 --> 00:20:20.210
...inside of you...

00:20:27.726 --> 00:20:30.524
Rokujo!

00:20:43.108 --> 00:20:44.575
Rokujo.

00:20:58.090 --> 00:20:59.114
Saya!

00:20:59.157 --> 00:21:01.352
Saya, where are you!?

00:21:21.880 --> 00:21:23.347
Saya!

00:21:39.031 --> 00:21:41.158
It's just as I said.

00:21:41.199 --> 00:21:45.033
You've taken the power...

00:21:45.070 --> 00:21:48.130
...of one, for now.

00:21:48.173 --> 00:21:49.504
Let Saya go!

